{"title":"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Graphing)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Graphing)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A positive number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> satisfies the inequality <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/d/42d01588c7804d8506acf7848a48d2ce9dffab72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{x} &lt; 2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" /> if and only if\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/1/2111d5e22427a2da92907399e5e86c89e24b5e7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\ x &gt; \\frac{1}{4} \\qquad \\text{(B)} \\ x &gt; 2 \\qquad \\text{(C)} \\ x &gt; 4 \\qquad \\text{(D)} \\ x &lt; \\frac{1}{4}\\qquad \\text{(E)} \\ x &lt; 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"512\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since both sides of this inequality are positive, we may square both sides to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/5/0056768101bd5ebad4df2ffdd2811f50c9651ac6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; 4x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is positive, we can divide both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/6/3c6e2dbb1eab81e2430c0afd806c7c36a7432dbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 &lt; 4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"55\" height=\"15\" />.  Dividing both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/d/f3df97e75ef04025c8614969bd31ea7d21a80959.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4} &lt; x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/4/9040df050e897844df2e06462cd8fff3ab515b16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(\\textbf{A})\\ x &gt; \\frac{1}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"95\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Graphing.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Graphing)\">Solution 2 (Graphing)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Graphing)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Graphing both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/0/4805dddb4e6911989af8be91da334b5ba2054757.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/c/2ec701493fa72dda5d6747fe14f30e7b1c2fb6c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> in Quadrant I of the coordinate plane, we see that the two curves intersect at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/7/187bca46874d17df4058ec701c10e73ac89cf013.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac{1}{4}, \\frac{1}{2}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"62\" height=\"45\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/c/96c115fa42e870332243e84fe355b552c4d5ab71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x &gt; \\sqrt{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"21\" /> whenever <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/4/9040df050e897844df2e06462cd8fff3ab515b16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(\\textbf{A})\\ x &gt; \\frac{1}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"95\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME\" title=\"1980 AHSME\">1980 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1980 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1980\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/